			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3760484">
									

<p>Thanks for the feedback! Glad it wasn't -10'd in a day.</p>
<p>As for the first note, SCP-████ is, in my mind, something that required D-Class to work together or was musically based, so having a band that presumably trusted each other on-hand to test with made sense.</p>
<p>As for the dollar, 1. The average researcher (and reader) probably doesn't need to know down to a single dollar the amount of damage, so I left it blank for the imagination. and 2. I didn't want to slam my number pad to come up with a random amount. If you think I'm wrong here (wouldn't be surprised if I was), just lemme know.</p>

